file lotus/tremolo.rye precheck factored out pub (additive) for the up-front atomic validation
file tools/ales_stereo_tremolo_witness.rish the witness proving it GREEN on metal
recommend keep-going the stereo modulation class is open; the next Lindy rungs carry the delay-line modulations (chorus, vibrato, flanger — each channel keeping its own delay-line state, like the band-pass) or the amplitude/ring family (ring_mod, auto_pan)
